   Unfortunatly, starting in a few day's my job is going to be requiring 
me to be away from my Internet connection for month's on end.  However,
this is not the death null of this list.  The list is being taken over 
by the more than capable Matthias 'rasca' Gmelch, who has been maintaining
the German/Austrian portion of the list for the past few months.  He can
be reached at rasca@marie.physik.tu-berlin.de .     
   It's been a fun year & a half (or thereabout) while maintianing the
list.  It's definitely grown into a lot more than I ever invisioned, and
I would like to think that it has aided in the spread of Linux among
those that don't have Internet ftp access.
   At least now I'll get to see what it's like running Linux on a 
