> endif

BTW: this method of conditionally including objects should get used
more seriously... to keep the kernels neat. :-)
 
If you want the SB Pro CDROM driver to work, you have to get the "original"
sbpcd.c from the sbpcd0.4.tar.gz package (to find at tsx-11, sunsite, nic,
