This is a correction to the color-ls-3.8.3 patch posted a few days
ago.  The source code to GNU fileutils-3.8.3.tar.gz is on:

	alpha.gnu.ai.mit.edu
                  ^^

not alpha.gnu.mit.edu as posted.

The patch itself is available on sunsite.unc.edu, currently in
/pub/Linux/Incoming, but it will probably be moved to
/pub/Linux/utils/file.

